  "description": "v059 with ONE change: training.epochs 3 -> 8. v059 is the project's strongest single-lever result (full_valid_wp 0.688676, public 0.6600) at lr 1e-3. The 8-epoch arm has been tried before but NEVER at this learning rate -- v037/v040/v044/v046 all ran 8 epochs at lr 0.002.",
